WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.040
I won't have it!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.120
I'll never forgive her for this!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.650
Indeed!

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.290
How dare that shameless du Barry
request His Majesty,

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.920
of all things, to make Oscar's
mother her lady-in-waiting!

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.550
That whore wants to use Oscar's
popularity to her advantage!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.600
She's using His Majesty's
affections to challenge you!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:42.230
Listen, Antoinette, even though the three
of us are His Majesty's daughters,

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.700
we are on your side no matter what.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.190
I understand, my Aunts.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:56.470
I will ask the Dauphin to make
Oscar's mother my lady-in-waiting!

