00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:36.740
episode

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:36.740
"Roses, Wine,
\h      and the Conspiracy..."

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.090
Why must it be my mother?!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:48.760
Then, Madame is to become the lady-in-waiting
for either Madame du Barry or Lady Antoinette?!

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:53.160
Lady Oscar, this request is a great honor!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.650
What are you so upset about...

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:54.650
Silence!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.670
I know why they're doing this!

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.440
Du Barry and the Dauphine...

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.940
Their true objective is to make me choose sides!

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:02.870
Hey, Oscar.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.700
Calm down.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.910
Eventually, you'll have to choose a side anyway.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.950
Might as well look at it in the long run.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.010
Shut up, André!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:11.980
I won't allow it!

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:16.790
I absolutely refuse to let my mother be used as a
pawn in the skirmishes of the women at court!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:17.550
Oscar.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.930
You don't have to worry about me.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:24.010
I'll serve whomever you think is best.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.260
No!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.980
I'll never allow my own mother to be dragged into
the power struggle between those two women!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.400
Oscar.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.990
This is an order from His Majesty.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:39.710
Regardless... Regardless of whom
the order is from, I still refuse!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:41.650
Father, please decline the request.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:46.990
Dear...

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.020
I know...

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.650
Give her some time and her head will cool.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.230
<i>At the same time, at the palace in Vienna,</i>

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:05.550
<i>another revered mother was heartbroken
about her daughter in Versailles.</i>

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:11.610
<i>Marie Antoinette's mother and
Empress of Austria, Maria Theresa.</i>

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.270
Have you called for me, Your Majesty?

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.870
Count Mercy, I would like you to go to France.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:25.820
To France?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.290
Antoinette is still very young.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.650
With all the fawning and flattery
at the foreign court,

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:35.470
I'm terribly worried she might become
a fool who doesn't think deeply enough.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:39.920
I ask that you be her adviser in my stead.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.970
As you wish, Your Majesty.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.460
I'm through with getting advice.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.460
That's not it.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.700
Why don't we have a bout, since it's been awhile?

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.460
All right.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.260
I'll take you on.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:21.920
You're fortunate!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.510
What?!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.710
I no longer have a mother to worry
about, even if I wanted to!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.690
Well? Do you give up?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:32.440
If you do, stop making your mother
worry and make a decision!

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.860
No matter which side I choose,
my mother will suffer regardless!

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.170
Disobeying His Majesty's order is treason!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:57.790
{I hear }His Majesty has graciously allowed the Jarjayes{ family} to choose
between serving Madame du Barry or the Dauphine.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.180
Yet listen to you...!

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:09.860
Come on! Make your decision!

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:14.640
The more stubborn you are, the more grief
you are causing your father and mother!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.880
<i>Mother, if I must choose...</i>

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.750
<i>Madame du Barry may be the most
powerful woman at court now,</i>

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:36.620
<i>but she has risen the ranks through shameful
means, and controls the King through seduction.</i>

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.060
<i>Rather than choose a woman like her, I will choose
Lady Antoinette, who is from a proper lineage.</i>

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.860
<i>Regardless, I swear to keep you safe, Mother!</i>

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:52.370
<i>The next day, all of Versailles...</i>

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:58.810
<i>...was talking feverishly about Marie Antoinette's
first victory over Madame du Barry.</i>

00:06:58.810 --> 00:06:59.880
My!

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.810
Lady Oscar has...

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.520
So then, Madame du Barry...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.480
Such a bold move by Oscar!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.530
Presenting Her Royal Highness, the Dauphine!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.210
<i>Curse you, Oscar...!</i>

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.130
<i>How dare someone of your position defy me!</i>

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:25.140
<i>That mother of yours will pay dearly for this!</i>

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.000
<i>Just you watch!</i>

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.850
My! Count Mercy!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:47.960
See?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.460
Isn't this garden just as beautiful as the
one back home in Schönbrunn Palace?

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.830
Indeed it is.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:57.840
On the day of my wedding ceremony,
it was opened to the commoners.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.880
They also raised fireworks and it was beautiful!

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:03.980
By the way, Lady Antoinette...

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.960
I have yet to see the Dauphin anywhere.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.970
Oh, the Dauphin is in the forge, making locks.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.340
Locks?

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.650
Locks as in, the ones with keys...?

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:20.320
Yes! Making locks is his hobby.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.930
What? Not even a word?

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:29.800
It's true! It's been 3 months already, but Lady Antoinette has yet to address her.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:35.470
When Madame du Barry learned that Lady Antoinette made Oscar's mother her lady-in-waiting...

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.200
That's right!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.440
She turned pale and was trembling in rage!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.790
All right, I'll bet on Lady Antoinette.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.580
Then, I'll bet 5000 livres on Madame du Barry!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:53.090
Either way, His Majesty is on the Madame's side.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.090
All right, I'll also bet 5000 livres on her!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.360
<i>Just what is going on?</i>

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:01.320
<i>Lady Antoinette is openly opposing
the King's mistress?!</i>

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.560
<i>Unbelievable! What if her actions...?</i>

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.960
<i>What if her actions anger the King?</i>

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.880
Austria

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.880
France

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.880
Switzerland

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:30.290
I won't forgive her! That brat!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.840
How dare she make a fool out of me!
I'll never forgive her!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.700
Your Majesty!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.740
Please do something! That brat is...

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.370
That topic again?

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.270
I don't want any more trouble.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:48.280
Do me a favor and leave me alone.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:59.560
Jewels, carriages...
You have everything you ever wanted.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.530
What else could you want—

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:01.530
No!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:04.300
Your Majesty is unaware of the rumors spreading through court.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:08.730
Because that redhead brat hasn't
addressed me, not even once,

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.170
I'm the laughingstock of the entire court!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:18.110
Until that brat addresses me, it means my
presence at court isn't formally recognized!

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.600
Yes, that's right! I'm being ridiculed!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.550
Your Majesty's duty is to protect me!

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:29.880
I've been forced to endure all these terrible insults
because Your Majesty hasn't done anything!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:39.260
You're being insulted because
I haven't done anything?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:42.710
Yes, as the one receiving Your Majesty's affections, an insult to me...

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.330
...is an insult to Your Majesty, as well!

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.770
An insult to me...?!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.420
Someone! Bring one of Antoinette's
attendants to my quarters at once!

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.250
This is a serious matter!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.100
His Majesty has personally...

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:06.020
...issued a warning to Lady Antoinette about your behavior towards Madame du Barry!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.530
Antoinette, there's nothing to worry about.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.570
That woman must have cried
until His Majesty agreed to act!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.470
Yes, that's right!

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:20.580
We are on your side, so you mustn't give
in to the likes of du Barry! Understand?

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.140
<i>How could this be...?</i>

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:29.310
<i>If the petty rivalry of these women causes
the treaty with Austria to be broken,</i>

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.870
<i>all of Europe will become engulfed in war!</i>

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.050
She is truly causing such trouble at Versailles?!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.430
The situation seems to be dire,

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.970
as Count Mercy has sent the letter in such haste.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:52.270
Please write a letter to Lady Antoinette
immediately, direct from Your Majesty!

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.860
<i>I could never do such a thing.</i>

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:05.610
<i>I have always taught her that for a woman to sell her body to men for money...</i>

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:08.420
<i>...or to become a mistress, is indecent.</i>

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:13.710
<i>How could I ever instruct my own daughter about her manners, towards a woman like Madame du Barry...</i>

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.730
Your Majesty!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.260
I understand your hesitation!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.430
However, the treaty with France
is at stake, so you must...!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.090
<i>Yes...</i>

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:28.400
<i>We mustn't do anything
to defy the French King.</i>

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.540
Kaunitz,

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.410
write the letter in my stead.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:37.020
If the instructions are from Prime Minister
Kaunitz, she will surely follow them.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.010
Yes!

00:12:54.400 --> 00:13:00.440
''Thus, insulting those in His Majesty's circle
is equal to insulting His Majesty himself,'

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:04.880
so you must rectify this matter immediately.''

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.910
...are the instructions from Prime Minister Kaunitz, Your Highness.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.410
Furthermore—

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.410
Yes, yes.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.550
I fully understand, so enough.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.950
Then, at the party tonight...
Are we in agreement, Lady Antoinette?

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.190
Once is enough, I understand!

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.220
Yes!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:24.390
<i>That grouchy old man Kaunitz!
He can say whatever he likes!</i>

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:29.620
<i>That aside, how did Austria get word of this?</i>

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.850
I hear she received a letter from
the Austrian Prime Minister.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.080
Then, Lady Antoinette will...?

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.340
Yes, she was finally persuaded.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.420
See, have a look.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:49.300
Look at how closely Lady Oscar
is accompanying the Dauphine.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.320
Of course, she's worried about her mother.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:54.270
After all, who knows what
Madame du Barry might do when she's angry.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.980
Speaking of which, I haven't
seen Madame du Barry yet.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.260
Look, it's Madame du Barry.

00:13:59.260 --> 00:13:59.940
Here she comes.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.570
Madame du Barry is finally making her entrance.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.160
My, she seems to be in an
unusually good mood today.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.670
Then, could the rumor about the
letter from Austria really be true?

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:11.180
It seems so.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:14.040
Perhaps today, Lady Antoinette will finally...

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.550
Yes. She might address Madame du Barry.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:20.780
Then, we are to witness the most dramatic event ever to happen at Versailles with our very own eyes?

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.960
<i>I was born a mere commoner in the city's slum,</i>

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:31.900
<i>but through painstaking effort,
I finally attained the rank of Countess.</i>

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:35.770
<i>The King's affections, political power,
jewels, palaces...</i>

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.540
<i>Everything I have ever wanted, I now possess.</i>

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.040
<i>All that remains is to make
the Dauphine address me,</i>

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:46.980
<i>and finally make that brat acknowledge
that I am more powerful than she is!</i>

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.140
<i>I can't!</i>

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:20.380
<i>Even if it's His Majesty's order, if I address her,</i>

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:25.680
<i>it would mean that I have acknowledged the
attendance of prostitutes and mistresses at court!</i>

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.390
<i>That should never be allowed!</i>

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:31.860
<i>I am no longer doing this because
my aunts pressed me to do so,</i>

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.960
<i>but because it has become my own concern!</i>

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.020
<i>Yes, my concern!</i>

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.790
<i>The honor of the Dauphine of France is at stake!</i>

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.980
My, such a fierce look on her face!

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.890
Lady Antoinette is livid!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.270
Look at her expression!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.420
Imagine what His Majesty would say!

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.980
How terrifying!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.190
<i>What has gotten into her?!</i>

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:07.700
<i>She can't possibly...</i>

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:12.550
<i>This brat doesn't intend to willfully defy the Prime Minister's instructions of her own country, does she?!</i>

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.950
<i>Lady Antoinette!</i>

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.900
That brat...!

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.820
Madame du Barry, you mustn't get so upset.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:05.250
I recently obtained a spectacular
wine from the Gold Coast of Africa.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.380
I thought perhaps Madame du Barry
would like a bottle as a gift...

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.300
This thing? It's just an ordinary bottle of wine.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.260
Indeed, an ordinary bottle of wine.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:19.760
It has a rich bouquet and is excellent on the palate.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:25.730
However, one drink and you will
be off to meet your Maker instantly.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:33.840
Not only that, this wine is so
spectacular, it leaves no trace.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:37.740
I'm sure you would find many
uses for it, Madame du Barry...?

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:48.920
Come in.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.430
Madame Jarjayes.

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:52.930
Yes?

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:58.840
The Dauphine has ordered that you  deliver wine to Madame du Barry's quarters.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:02.190
The Dauphine would like it delivered
to Madame du Barry's quarters?

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:03.440
Yes.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.140
<i>That's rather strange...</i>

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:09.650
<i>Lady Antoinette, who despises Madame du Barry,
would like it delivered to her quarters?</i>

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.720
Please hurry!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:15.750
The two are engaged in a discussion in her private
quarters, on His Majesty's secret order!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.920
His Majesty's...?!

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.590
Then, why wasn't the order given to the
servant in charge of bringing the wine?

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:24.450
After all, Lady Antoinette has 168
servants in charge of her meals.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.910
The order was specifically made to you, Madame Jarjayes!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.780
I have brought some wine for the Dauphine.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.400
My, Madame Jarjayes!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.830
I'm sorry to trouble you for such a thing.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:02.800
Not at all.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.410
Um, may I ask where Lady Antoinette is?

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:11.080
Oh, I'm afraid Lady Antoinette has just left.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:17.460
Oscar!

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.050
André.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.920
What has you so panicked?

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:23.820
Your mother has just gone to
Madame du Barry's apartment!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.390
Oscar, are you aware of this?!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.480
What?! My mother?!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:31.350
She was ordered to bring wine,
supposedly on Lady Antoinette's order!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.440
Damn it!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.640
I'll have a glass since you brought it all this way.

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:49.200
You, come here and have a glass, as well.

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.520
My, you are offering someone like me a glass?!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.750
Thank you!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:58.670
Why yes. After all, Madame Jarjayes went
through the trouble of bringing me this wine.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.240
What's wrong?! Pull yourself together!

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:31.720
Poison!

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.540
The wine was poisoned!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.420
H-How could this be...?!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.560
<i>Oh no! It was a trap...</i>

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.500
<i>It was all Madame du Barry's trap!</i>

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.530
<i>This is her revenge towards me for
choosing to serve Lady Antoinette!</i>

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.470
Madame Jarjayes!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.640
You would dare serve me poisoned wine!

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:53.410
Did the Dauphine order you to do this?!

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.850
Or did you plot this yourself?!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.830
What a ruthless person!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.420
To use your servant's life as if it were a tool!

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:12.700
H-How dare you!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:13.790
What are you talking about?!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:17.570
You specifically made my mother
bring you poisoned wine,

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.400
just so you could blame her for
attempting to poison and murder you!

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.760
Such cowardice!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.470
H-How dare you suggest such a thing!

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:27.900
Do you really think I can't see through your
thinly-veiled charade, Madame du Barry?!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.920
Regardless of what kind of woman you are,

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:38.760
you are a woman who has been graciously
bestowed His Majesty's affections.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:42.440
I will not mention a word of what has
happened here tonight, so do not worry.

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:44.190
But remember this!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:48.000
As long as I am here,

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:52.080
I won't let you entrap Lady Antoinette
or my mother ever again!

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.600
Let's go, Mother.

